Z||000000||Tigger||08-25-2001||08:11 PM||||Had a couple sprinkles of rain today but overall had a great meet at Frances park in Lansing.  Unfortunately, StansGT won the hard luck award with a flat tire on the way to the meet.<P>It was cool to talk Fieros, hang out, relax, and have a good time.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1miforummeet01.jpg">            <BR>Left to right:<BR>MooCow, Fieromaster88, jch82, FieroJoe, Fred88GT, ChopTop, Tigger, StansGT<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1miforummeet04.jpg">     <BR>MooCow's GT & FieroMaster88's V6 Coupe<P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1miforummeet05.jpg">     <BR>FieroJoe's '87 Coupe<P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1miforummeet06.jpg">     <BR>Fred88GT's '88 GT<P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1miforummeet07.jpg">     <BR>ChopTop's GT!<P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1miforummeet08.jpg">     <BR>StansGT<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1miforummeet09.jpg">     <BR>jch82's work in progress '85 GT<p>[This message has been edited by Tigger (edited 08-25-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000001||Tigger||08-25-2001||09:29 PM||||   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1miforummeet03.jpg">       <BR>FieroJoe having some fun!        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1miforummeet02.jpg">  <P>If you missed this one, we are looking to have another meet in a few weeks.<p>[This message has been edited by Tigger (edited 08-25-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||FieroKyle||08-25-2001||09:51 PM||||sniff sniff sniff, I missed. it I missed it. =(, the car is in the body shop still. I found out some information (I know the guys at the body shop somewhat). One it has been in a wreck before and the people who fixed it did a poor job on it. Two, it has had about 5 paint jobs. This is sorta scary. But the car seemed to run great even though apparently it has been in wreck. I mean no bad things (most cars after a wreck are never right again). Like grinding noises with the wheels, dents in vechile, ect....||||reg||9
Z||000003||FieroJoe||08-25-2001||11:03 PM||||haha, I thought I saw you take a pic Brent!  I didnt really mean to do a donut but that rear sway bar makes the back end step out easier!  hehehe it was fun!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Overall it turned out great, the park was pretty cool also seeing as we had our own little parking lot there.  Nice to see people again and meet some new ones.<P>Next time we do it, we need more people!||||reg||1
Z||000004||MooCow||08-25-2001||11:23 PM||||Yes it was a very fun time.  Need to do it again soon.  Very nice pics.  Will upload mine as soon as I get them on the computer.<P>Thanks Ken<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_7.jpg"> <BR>87 GT, 3.4 engine with a 4:10 tranny, and Viper Yellow!||||reg||12
