Z||000011||gargoyle||08-26-2001||04:48 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif"> Hey Tigger, Looked like a nice meet. You guys had a real rainbow in your cars. I have to really give you a THUMBS UP on your car. I really like that orange!! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif"> If Pontiac had only offered that. September is looking pretty busy, maybe if you have one in October I'll motor up there. Michigan is my home state. I'm just a military transplant to Illinois.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ||||reg||14
Z||000012||Tigger||08-27-2001||12:25 AM||||Thanks gargoyle.  We had a good turnout on such short notice.<P>Checking my PFF calender, Saturday September 22nd looks good for the next meet, don't know of any Fiero shows going on that weekend.  Pretty sure the MI Fiero club color cruise is the first weekend in October, any weekend other than that should be good.<P>How does September 22nd sound for the next meet?||||reg||1
Z||000013||FieroKyle||08-27-2001||01:10 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Tigger:<BR><B>Thanks gargoyle.  We had a good turnout on such short notice.<P>Checking my PFF calender, Saturday September 22nd looks good for the next meet, don't know of any Fiero shows going on that weekend.  Pretty sure the MI Fiero club color cruise is the first weekend in October, any weekend other than that should be good.<P>How does September 22nd sound for the next meet?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>If thats on a Saturday, I will be there!!! HaHa, car should be outta the body shop by then, I miss car so much. Looks like it was a nice meet. I will have to show FieroJoe how to do a good donut, lol =). All from practice in Meijer parking lots.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>||||reg||1
Z||000014||FieroMaster88||08-27-2001||01:23 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Tigger:<BR><B>Thanks gargoyle.  We had a good turnout on such short notice.<P>Checking my PFF calender, Saturday September 22nd looks good for the next meet, don't know of any Fiero shows going on that weekend.  Pretty sure the MI Fiero club color cruise is the first weekend in October, any weekend other than that should be good.<P>How does September 22nd sound for the next meet?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Well..If I have the money and I am not going to the Nopi Nationals I will defenatly be there.  I am about 75% sure I am not going to NOPI...costs too much!<P><P>------------------<BR>            <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FieroMaster88.gif">            <BR>James Essar<BR>AOL IM Name: FieroMaster88<BR>88 Coupe With a new V6<BR>5 speed Isuzu trans<BR>AcCel 8mm wires<BR>rapid fire plugs<BR>custom intake with K&N filter.<BR>Soon to be 2" closer to the ground and have a turbo||||reg||1
Z||000015||ChopTop||08-27-2001||01:33 PM||||What the forum didn't know was the park was pretty packed, we just happen to stumble on this empty parking lot in the park, hence FieroJoe's impromptu "safety check" of his cars suspension.  For such a short notice I though it was a great turn out.  Tell you what, if we hold it in the same location on September 22, I'll volunteer to bring a grill and cook up burgers.  Thanks for suggesting Tigger, had a nice time meeting everyone.  See ya.||||reg||14
